77 < 1 ## Traps
78 < 1 
79 < 1 - The exe HTTP-proxy edge replaces `Authorization` unconditionally, with no only-if-absent
80 < 1   option, so wrangler's asset-upload JWT is refused (#1312).
81 < 1 - A catalog user API token needs `account_id` left blank in exe's verify, or it 401s.
82 < 1 - Cloudflare's builder ships bun 1.2.15, which can't read a bun 1.4 lockfile: set `BUN_VERSION`.
83 < 1 